    "width_rule_per_layer": "clip(4.0 * round(std, 4), 0.005, 0.020) \u2014 std is the layer tensor's own, coarsened to 4 decimals so embed (original) and extract (stego) bucket identically; measured embed shift <= 0.0153% per layer",
